error[E0277]: the format `Json` cannot open a stream of `String`
 --> tests/ui_stream/finite_format_for_stream.rs:3:1
  |
3 | / concord::api! {
4 | |     pub client Finite {
5 | |         base "http://x.test";
6 | |         GET events() -> stream String { response concord::Json; }
7 | |     }
8 | | }
  | |_^ this streaming output's format is `Json` (the nearest `response` statement: on the endpoint, a scope or the client); it needs `Json: Incremental<String>`
  |
  = help: the trait `Incremental<String>` is not implemented for `Json`
  = note: `-> stream T` needs a format implementing `Incremental<String>` (an incremental reader); a finite `-> T` needs `Decode<String>`; `-> stream` without an item returns the unread `Incoming` body
  = help: the following other types implement trait `Incremental<T>`:
            `Csv<H, D, P>` implements `Incremental<RawRecord>`
            `Csv<H, D, P>` implements `Incremental<T>`
            `IgnoreContentType<F>` implements `Incremental<T>`
            `JsonLines` implements `Incremental<T>`
            `JsonStream` implements `Incremental<T>`
            `Ndjson` implements `Incremental<T>`
            `Sse` implements `Incremental<Event>`
  = note: this error originates in the macro `concord::api` (in Nightly builds, run with -Z macro-backtrace for more info)

